<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GERMAN OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GERMAN OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results at the $926,000 German Open women's tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>12-Mary Pierce (France) beat Elena Wagner (Germany) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>11-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat Patty Schnyder (Switzerland) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Eva Martincova (Czech Republic) beat 16-Yelena Likhovtseva (Russia) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Sandrine Testud (France) beat Ai Sugiyama (Japan) 6-2  6-1</p>
<p>Barbara Rittner (Germany) beat Els Callens (Belgium) 6-1 6-0  </p>
<p>Anna Kurnikova (Russia) beat Sylvia Plischke (Austria) 6-2 6-2</p>
<p>Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat Wang Shi Ting (Taiwan) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>1-Steffi Graf (Germany) beat Chanda Rubin (U.S.) 6-3 3-6 6-1</p>
<p>15-Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Alexandra Fusai (France)</p>
<p>6-2 6-2</p>
<p>8-Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Tatyana Panova (Russia) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-2) 6-2</p>
<p>Add second round:</p>
<p>5-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) beat Barbara Schett (Austria)</p>
<p>6-2 4-6 7-5</p>
<p>Add first round:</p>
<p>Adriana Gersi (Czech Republic) beat 13-Barbara Paulus (Austria)</p>
<p>7-5 6-7 (1-7) 6-4</p>
<p>Sandra Kleinova (Czech Republic) beat Jana Kandarr (Germany)</p>
<p>6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Katarina Studenikova (Slovakia) beat Joanette Kruger (South</p>
<p>Africa) 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Add first round:</p>
<p>Ines Gorrochategui (Argentina) beat Wiltrud Probst (Germany)</p>
<p>6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Add second round:</p>
<p>10-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat Maria Sanchez Lorenzo (Spain)</p>
<p>6-4 1-6 6-3</p>
</text>
